From: "evgenii.zelenkov" <evgenii.zelenkov@gdasuclite.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 14:22:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat: add narrow void detection, ignore threshold, and UI
 improvements

- vase_bottom_gap_fill_min_aspect: detect narrow elongated voids by
  bbox aspect ratio and fill them with a stroke along the long axis
- vase_bottom_seal_ignore_area: global threshold to skip voids too
  small to matter (closed by over-extrusion); visible when either
  sealing pass is enabled
- Move ignore_area UI to micro-void section so it stays visible
  when only micro-void pass is on
- Fix cache invalidation: register all new keys in Print.cpp and
  PrintObject.cpp so settings changes reliably trigger re-slice

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
