From 5683d4bd19e3335125bd78d2bbdc0a0fb5522aa7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "evgenii.zelenkov" <evgenii.zelenkov@gdasuclite.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 19:02:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] feat: per-layer area overrides + UI reorganization

- Move all vase bottom sealing options to new "Vase Bottom Sealing"
  section in Others tab (separate from Special Mode)
- Add vase_bottom_per_layer_override checkbox: when enabled, exposes
  per-layer overrides for Large void min area and Micro void max area
  for layers 1-8 (0 = use global value)
- Add vase_bottom_gap_fill_min_aspect for narrow elongated void detection
- Add vase_bottom_seal_ignore_area: global threshold to skip tiny voids
- Fix cache invalidation: substr(0,17) for vase_bottom_layer* keys
- Per-layer values only read when vase_bottom_per_layer_override is on

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
